                <td style="width: 240.396px; height: 35px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Mucosal Involvement</bold></p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 531.604px; height: 35px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Usually not found in the mucosa</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 528px; height: 35px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Common (mucosal or subcutaneous lesions)</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 35px;">
                <td style="width: 240.396px; height: 35px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Compressibility</bold></p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 531.604px; height: 35px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Incompletely compressible</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 528px; height: 35px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Readily compressible, decreases with external pressure and limb elevation</p>
</td>
              </tr>
